OL,3,GNEWSAMan stabbed to death at council
OL,4,Aheadquarters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young man has died after being
OL,7,Fstabbed in a building housing Brent
OL,8,FCouncil's headquarters and a library.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called at about
OL,11,F14:30 BST to Brent Civic Centre, near
OL,12,FWembley Stadium in north-west London,
OL,13,Fwhere the victim was pronounced dead at
OL,14,Fthe scene.
OL,16,FThe Met Police said he was believed to
OL,17,Fbe a teenage boy or man in his early
OL,18,F20s.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
