OL,3,GNEWSAMan stabbed to death at council
OL,4,Aheadquarters
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo arrests have been made and officers
OL,7,Fare making urgent inquiries to identify
OL,8,Fand trace those responsible, the Met
OL,9,Fsaid.
